OL,3,A'It gave us goosebumps': First visitors
OL,4,Asee Bayeux Tapestry as London
OL,5,Aexhibition opens
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bayeux Tapestry is on public
OL,8,Fdisplay in the UK for the first time
OL,9,Fsince it was created nearly 1,000 years
OL,10,Fago
OL,12,FThe 70m-long (230ft) tapestry has been
OL,13,Finspiring artists since the Middle Ages
OL,14,F- one man spent 40 years
OL,15,Fcross-stitching a replica
OL,17,FNothing prepared me for how I felt when
OL,18,FI looked down on it for the first time,
OL,19,Four culture editor writes
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
